Just a note for the future:

The easiest way for a character who can't cast Remove Curse to remove
curses: keep some holy water/scroll of remove curse in a sack or
oilskin bag. The sack may become cursed, but the items inside won't,
and if your BoH gets hit, you can pull out your curse-remover and fix
things instantly.

